  <h2 id="other-choices">Other choices when specifying a zipper</h2>
  <p>
    Size is only one decision. You will also choose coil vs tooth (metal or molded plastic), separating
    vs closed-end, length, tape color, and whether you need a locking slider. Those options will expand
    on this page as we build out studio zipper guidance. Sewing them in is covered under Skills to Learn
    (Zipper installation).
  </p>
